<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00454/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一把高约0.75m的实木椅子，任何<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">人</span>生物坐在其上时均会不可避免的（以头朝下的姿势）摔倒在地。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-█，Dr.4826的办公室。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被永久保存在Site-█，Dr.4826的办公室内。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>我就不信邪了，██的，我堂堂七尺男儿还坐不上去一把椅子？——Dr.4826<br />
兄弟们，你们要是想我就多来医院看看我，哎呦&#8230;我的脑袋&#8230;——Dr.4826<br />
阿巴阿巴阿巴阿巴阿巴阿巴——Dr.4826</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00454" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00454" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00454-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ngc-4826" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6285237); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6285237&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607070499" alt="NGC-4826" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6285237)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ngc-4826" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6285237); return false;">NGC-4826</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1604823683 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">08 Nov 2020 08:21</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00241/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>项目为一个挂钟，当有不超过2人注视它时，它的时间将会自动变为注视者所要做的下一件事的1小时前<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong> Dr. Fox的家中<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong> 被储存于site-CN-██的低价值物品储存柜中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><br />
<em>主管你听我解释我真不是故意迟到的啊喂！</em><br />
<em>———Dr. Fox</em></p>
<p><em>没人会迟到19个小时的，Dr.Fox</em><br />
<em>———站点主管████</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00241" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00241" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00241-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nightingale-fz" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6348925); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6348925&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607070499" alt="Nightingale_FZ" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6348925)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nightingale-fz" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6348925); return false;">Nightingale_FZ</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1591432139 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">06 Jun 2020 08:28</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00461/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一本███页的小说，每次打开时名称、内容、人名和对话都会转变为其他小说的内容<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██市██街新华书店<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于Site-CN-██的图书室中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>古之帝王一把抓住李狗蛋的脖子？——正在新华书店买书的研究员guzl</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00461" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00461" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00461-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/guzl" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6264210); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6264210&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607070499" alt="guzl" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6264210)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/guzl" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6264210); return false;">guzl</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1605343870 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">14 Nov 2020 08:51</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00186/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一台电视，当两名观看者观看电视时，其中一名观看者会有强烈的调至新闻频道，而另一名会想要调至体育频道。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>一家位于██的家电商店中发现，同批次物品无异常。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被收容于Site-CN-24的低价值物品收容柜<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>Storeshoes你都已经看了这么久的新闻了，让我看一会体育。——Dr.Frank<br />
还我调控器，我还没看完新闻呢。——Dr.Storeshoes</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00186" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00186" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00186-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/storeshoes" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6056485); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6056485&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607070499" alt="storeshoes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6056485)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/storeshoes" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6056485); return false;">storeshoes</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1589246054 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">12 May 2020 01:14</span></p>
</div>
